title: GemLiliana
---
Liliana: Hello, {$playerName}.
<<if $gemQuestComplete>>
    Liliana: Thank you again for finding that gem.
<<elseif has_item("gem")>>
    Liliana: Wait...
    Liliana: Is that the gem I've been looking for?
    -> Give the Gem
        {$playerName}: You mean this?
        Liliana: Yes! That's exactly the one.
        <<remove_item GameManager "gem">>
        <<set $gemQuestComplete = true>>
        Liliana: Thank you. I've been searching everywhere for it.
        Liliana: I want you to have something in return.
        Liliana: I found this some time ago. Perhaps you'll find someone who would appreciate it.
        <<give_special_gift GameManager>>
        {$playerName}: Thank you.
    -> Keep the Gem
        {$playerName}: I think I'll hold onto it for now.
        Liliana: Very well. Let me know if you change your mind.
<<else>>
    Liliana: I'm looking for a strange gem.
    Liliana: If you happen to find one, would you bring it to me?
<<endif>>
===